# Application of Double Centralizer Theorem to V^\{⊗n\}
%%%
tag := "Chapter5/Discussion_before_Theorem5.18.2"
number := false
%%%

We will now apply Theorem 5.18.1 to the following situation: $`E = V^{\otimes n}`, where $`V` is a finite dimensional vector space over a field $`k` of characteristic zero and $`A` is the image of $`k[S_n]` in $`\operatorname{End} E`. Let us now characterize the algebra $`B`. Let $`\mathfrak{gl}(V)` be $`\operatorname{End} V` regarded as a Lie algebra with operation $`ab - ba`.
